      <title>Buffs complete sweep of Sierra</title>
      <link>https://www.mantecabulletin.com/sports/high-school-sports/buffs-complete-sweep-of-sierra/</link>
      <description>Manteca got six runners on base in the first three innings Friday at Sierra but only had one run to show for it. That all changed in a six-run fourth inning due in part to Devon Richardson’s three-run home run, and the Buffaloes never looked back in a 12-3 win in Valley Oak League baseball action at Jack Thomson Stadium.</description>
